<title>USA: NY/NJ Port Authority to sell $100 mln bonds Oct 16.</title>
<headline>NY/NJ Port Authority to sell $100 mln bonds Oct 16.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Port Authority of New York and New Jersey will sell $100 million consolidated revenue bonds in a competitive sale set for 1100 EDT Oct 16, a market source familiar with the sale said Friday.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
